            <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">AI Operations Partner</p>
            <ul class="mt-7 grid gap-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand/80">
              {[
                '10+ års erfaring med operations, supply chain og procesoptimering.',
